# Keep LF in the working tree.
#
# core.autocrlf is true on this machine (system config), so without this a
# checkout would rewrite every source file to CRLF. These files are LF today
# and the plugin is loaded by Node as an ESM module; silent line-ending
# churn would make the whole tree look modified after any checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never normalise binary assets.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
